 <div class="lw"><p class="eyb"><span>03 · Services</span></p><h2 id="h-services">Software Development Services in Karachi &amp; Remotely</h2><p class="lead nar">Whether you need a local Karachi partner for a startup product or a dedicated remote full-stack developer in Pakistan for an international platform, these are the core services I deliver for businesses that need more than a brochure website.</p>
 <div class="sgrid"><article class="sv"><span class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 5h18l-7 8v6l-4-2v-4z"/></svg></span><span class="nn">01</span><h3>Custom CRM &amp; ERP Systems</h3><p>Lead routing engines, pipeline stages, role-based dashboards, vendor management, approval workflows and operational reporting built around how your teams actually work. Not a Salesforce clone. See <a class="il" href="<?= base_url('/crm-developers-pakistan') ?>">CRM developers in Pakistan</a><!-- DYNAMIC: route('landing.show', 'crm') -->.</p></article><article class="sv"><span class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="8" height="8" rx="2"/><rect x="13" y="3" width="8" height="8" rx="2"/><rect x="3" y="13" width="8" height="8" rx="2"/><rect x="13" y="13" width="8" height="8" rx="2"/></svg></span><span class="nn">02</span><h3>SaaS Platform Development</h3><p>Multi-tenant architecture, subscription logic, admin panels and versioned API layers, so your product can onboard new clients, isolate their data and scale without rebuilding. See <a class="il" href="javascript:void(0)">SaaS &amp; web development</a><!-- DYNAMIC: internal link -> route() -->.</p></article><article class="sv"><span class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="5" cy="6" r="2.5"/><circle cx="19" cy="18" r="2.5"/><path d="M7.5 6H14a4 4 0 0 1 0 8h-4a4 4 0 0 0 0 8"/></svg></span><span class="nn">03</span><h3>Business Process Automation</h3><p>Webhooks, scheduled jobs, approval chains and notification engines, so repetitive manual tasks run in the background. See <a class="il" href="javascript:void(0)">business process automation</a><!-- DYNAMIC: internal link -> route() -->.</p></article><article class="sv"><span class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2.5"/><path d="m8.2 11 7.6-4M8.2 13l7.6 4"/></svg></span><span class="nn">04</span><h3>REST API &amp; Integrations</h3><p>Documented JSON endpoints for mobile apps, partner systems and headless frontends, with Sanctum or Passport auth, validation and rate limiting. Integrations include payment gateways, SMS providers and third-party CRMs.</p></article><article class="sv"><span class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18M8 13h5M8 16h8"/></svg></span><span class="nn">05</span><h3>Admin Portals &amp; Internal Tools</h3><p>Secure dashboards with granular RBAC permissions, bulk actions, exports and audit history, so managers control data without waiting on developer tickets.</p></article><article class="sv"><span class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20V5M6 11l6-6 6 6"/><path d="M4 20h16"/></svg></span><span class="nn">06</span><h3>Legacy System Modernization</h3><p>Upgrading aging PHP or Laravel codebases to PHP 8+, closing security gaps, fixing slow queries and restructuring for maintainability, without a full rewrite. See <a class="il" href="<?= base_url('/laravel-developer-karachi') ?>">Laravel developer in Karachi</a><!-- DYNAMIC: route('landing.show', 'laravel') -->.</p></article><article class="sv"><span class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="7" y="2" width="10" height="20" rx="2.5"/><path d="M11 18h2"/></svg></span><span class="nn">07</span><h3>Mobile Apps (Flutter)</h3><p>Cross-platform iOS and Android apps in Flutter and Dart, connected to your Laravel REST API, with Firebase auth or push where needed. See <a class="il" href="javascript:void(0)">Flutter e-commerce app case study</a><!-- DYNAMIC: internal link -> route() --> · <a class="il" href="javascript:void(0)">real-time chat apps</a><!-- DYNAMIC: internal link -> route() -->.</p></article></div></div>
</section>

