 <div class="lw"><p class="eyb"><span>04 · Industries</span></p><h2 id="h-industries">Industries I Build Software For</h2><p class="lead nar">Custom software decisions are always domain-specific. Work across these verticals means I understand the data models, compliance pressures and workflow patterns before the first architecture call.</p>
