ink -> route() -->.</p></div></div><div><span class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 6h12v10H2zM14 10h4l4 4v2h-8z"/><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="2"/><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2"/></svg></span><div><h3>Logistics &amp; Field Service</h3><p>Vendor management, job dispatch, SLA tracking and route operations. See: <a class="il" href="javascript:void(0)">ticketing CRM portal</a><!-- DYNAMIC: internal link -> route() -->.</p></div></div></div></div>
