<section class="lsec rv " id="process" aria-labelledby="h-process"><!-- DYNAMIC: $landing->sections[4] (steps) -->
 <div class="lw"><p class="eyb"><span>05 · Process</span></p><h2 id="h-process">How I Run Projects: From Discovery to Production</h2><p class="lead nar">Clear milestones reduce risk, especially when working with a remote developer in Pakistan for the first time. Every project follows the same four stages, whether the client is in Karachi or California.</p>
 <ol class="hsteps" style="--n:4"><li><span class="sn">01</span><b>Discovery &amp; Audit</b><p>Map workflows, user roles, integrations and pain points before code. Define success metrics so scope stays realistic.</p></li><li><span class="sn">02</span><b>Architecture</b><p>Database schema, API contracts, queue strategy, tenant model and security layers documented before development begins.</p></li><li><span class="sn">03</span><b>Development &amp; QA</b><p>Focused sprints with Git, demos every one to two weeks, and QA on auth, payments, lead routing and API contracts before release.</p></li><li><span class="sn">04</span><b>Deployment &amp; Handover</b><p>Production deploy with queues, cron, SSL and documentation. A full team walkthrough so your staff can operate the system after launch.</p></li></ol></div>
</section>

<section class="lsec rv " id="stack" aria-labelledby="h-stack"><!-- DYNAMIC: $landing->sections[5] (stack) -->
 <div class="lw"><p class="eyb"><span>06 · Stack</span></p><h2 id="h-stack">Technology Stack for Enterprise Software</h2><p class="lead nar">I choose tools based on project load, maintainability and long-term upgrade paths, not framework trends.</p><div class="stk"><div><b>Backend</b><span>PHP 8+, Laravel: strict typing, current LTS</span></div><div><b>Database</b><span>MySQL with indexing for CRM-scale data</span></div><div><b>Caching &amp; queues</b><span>Redis, Laravel Horizon for imports &amp; jobs</span></div><div><b>Authentication</b><span>Sanctum &amp; Passport for SPAs, mobile, partners</span></div><div><b>Frontend (web)</b><span>Blade, Vue.js, or API-only as needed</span></div><div><b>Mobile</b><span>Flutter / Dart, Firebase, Laravel API backends</span></div><div><b>Infrastructure</b><span>VPS or AWS, SSL, backups, zero-downtime deploys</span></div><div><b>Workflow</b><span>Git branching, documented handovers</span></div></div>
 <div class="lnote"><p>Need deep Laravel specialization? <a class="il" href="<?= base_url('/laravel-developer-karachi') ?>">Laravel developer in Karachi</a><!-- DYNAMIC: route('landing.show', 'laravel') -->. CRM-specific architecture? <a class="il" href="<?= base_url('/crm-developers-pakistan') ?>">CRM developers in Pakistan</a><!-- DYNAMIC: route('landing.show', 'crm') -->.</p></div></div>
</section>

<section class="lsec rv tint" id="local" aria-labelledby="h-local"><!-- DYNAMIC: $landing->sections[6] (local) -->
 <div class="lw"><p class="eyb"><span>07 · Why Karachi</span></p><h2 id="h-local">Why Hire a Software Developer in Karachi</h2><p class="lead nar">Karachi is Pakistan’s largest commercial city and one of South Asia’s most active technology hubs. For international clients, hiring a senior developer here delivers three practical advantages.</p><div class="loc"><div><span class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3 4 6v6c0 5 3.5 8 8 9 4.5-1 8-4 8-9V6z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h3>Cost-effective senior expertise</h3><p>Someone who has shipped multi-tenant CRMs, payroll systems and high-volume REST APIs, not a junior learning on your budget, at a fraction of equivalent US or UK agency rates.</p></div><div><span class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg></span><h3>Timezone compatibility</h3><p>Karachi (PKT, UTC+5) overlaps well with UAE, Saudi Arabia and European hours. US clients, particularly East Coast, get morning async overlap with end-of-day delivery, plus scheduled Zoom calls.</p></div><div><span class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 4.8-7 11-7 11z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.5"/></svg></span><h3>Local and remote flexibility</h3><p>Karachi businesses can arrange on-site discovery and architecture sessions. International clients follow the same remote process via Slack, Zoom and GitHub.</p></div></div>
 <div class="lnote"><p>See the full <a class="il" href="javascript:void(0)">services</a><!-- DYNAMIC: internal link -> route() --> portfolio, or read about <a class="il" href="javascript:void(0)">web development growth strategy</a><!-- DYNAMIC: internal link -> route() -->.</p></div></div>
</section>

